+/* GIMP - The GNU Image Manipulation Program
+ * chopgimp-trace.cc — ChopGimp 3.27.3 (lot V5): « Vectoriser » engines
+ *
+ * See chopgimp-trace.h. Pipeline:
+ *
+ *   pixels (R'G'B'A u8, selection mask applied)
+ *     → optional box blur (≈ gaussian)
+ *     → labels: threshold (BW), k-means in Lab (GRAY / COLOR, AUTO with
+ *       merging of close colors, LIMITED), nearest custom color (CUSTOM)
+ *     → speckles smaller than « noise » merged into their neighbour
+ *     → one bitmap per color (ABUTTING: the color alone; OVERLAPPING:
+ *       the color and every color drawn above it), largest area at the
+ *       bottom
+ *     → POTRACE: libpotrace per bitmap, passes run in parallel; thin parts
+ *       (« strokes ») to CENTERLINE; CENTERLINE: autotrace (centerline
+ *       mode, serialized: autotrace has global state) with the width
+ *       measured on a euclidean distance transform; PIXELART: libdepixelize
+ *     → shapes (SVG path data, image coordinates)
+ *
+ * This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
+ * it under the terms of the GNU General Public License as published by
+ * the Free Software Foundation; either version 3 of the License, or
+ * (at your option) any later version.
+ */
